{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/New_capsule.jpg?t=1744223973\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<i> Check out our Kickstarter Campaign now for Fireside Fables!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Kickstarter_1.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fireside Fables is a<strong> narrative driven 3D platformer</strong>, which follows a group of children telling stories around a campfire. These stories then come to life, and you<strong> play through them as your favourite plushie!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Main_Gif_Smaller.gif?t=1744223973\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be transported across worlds! From a pirate island, to a lush forest, even to outer space - <strong>Anywhere that the children's imaginations can take you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Pirate_Run.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Kickstarter_2.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fireside Fables will tell a<strong> heartwarming story</strong> about a group of children, who escape into their imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before you start your journey into each world, you will have time to <strong>sit at the campfire with the other children.</strong> You will be able to learn their thoughts, feelings, loves, fears...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/CAMPFIRE.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over the course of the game, the underlying narrative will begin to show itself. <strong>There is more to these kids than initially seems</strong>...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/b7a6eaebbde8fb6689ba5e3624c751f8_original.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>InkForge Studios </strong>is supporting<strong> Great Ormond Street Hospital Charity (GOSH Charity) </strong>by donating<strong> 25% </strong>of the game\u2019s<strong> Steam revenue!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">InkForge Studios Creative Director, <strong>Thomas Hunt</strong>, is a outpatient at GOSH. From the <strong>age of just 2 weeks old</strong>, Tom had to undergo an operation and has been a <strong>patient there ever since</strong>. This was what initially fueled our desire to develop our previous title, 'I'll be Brave, Tomorrow' in partnership with GOSH, and the same is true for 'Fireside Fables'!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365560?t=1744223973","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365560?t=1744223973","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/39d10cb275c7fea1b55ae83833fd63f0d6b0ce49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744223973","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/39d10cb275c7fea1b55ae83833fd63f0d6b0ce49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744223973","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>London Games Festival</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Key_Art_with_logo.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have been selected to take part in the London Games Festival 2025! Play a demo of Fireside Fables at New Game Plus\u00a0Thursday 3 April &amp; Friday 4 April, and keep an eye out for the Steam event!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/New_capsule.jpg?t=1744223973\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<i> Check out our Kickstarter Campaign now for Fireside Fables!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Kickstarter_1.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fireside Fables is a<strong> narrative driven 3D platformer</strong>, which follows a group of children telling stories around a campfire. These stories then come to life, and you<strong> play through them as your favourite plushie!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Main_Gif_Smaller.gif?t=1744223973\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be transported across worlds! From a pirate island, to a lush forest, even to outer space - <strong>Anywhere that the children's imaginations can take you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Pirate_Run.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/Kickstarter_2.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fireside Fables will tell a<strong> heartwarming story</strong> about a group of children, who escape into their imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before you start your journey into each world, you will have time to <strong>sit at the campfire with the other children.</strong> You will be able to learn their thoughts, feelings, loves, fears...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/CAMPFIRE.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over the course of the game, the underlying narrative will begin to show itself. <strong>There is more to these kids than initially seems</strong>...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/b7a6eaebbde8fb6689ba5e3624c751f8_original.png?t=1744223973\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>InkForge Studios </strong>is supporting<strong> Great Ormond Street Hospital Charity (GOSH Charity) </strong>by donating<strong> 25% </strong>of the game\u2019s<strong> Steam revenue!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">InkForge Studios Creative Director, <strong>Thomas Hunt</strong>, is a outpatient at GOSH. From the <strong>age of just 2 weeks old</strong>, Tom had to undergo an operation and has been a <strong>patient there ever since</strong>. This was what initially fueled our desire to develop our previous title, 'I'll be Brave, Tomorrow' in partnership with GOSH, and the same is true for 'Fireside Fables'!</p></li></ul>","developers":["InkForge Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/e2af8aa5c999917e4fa2312754e255dae3c0b2b9/header.jpg?t=1744223973","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114517,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114517/movie480.mp4?t=1741973115","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114517/movie_max.mp4?t=1741973115"},"name":"Kickstarter Trailer (Short)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114517/60242f5f3b6411efa5e845945ca77ceb0423a26d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741973115","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114517/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741973115","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114517/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741973115"}}],"name":"Fireside Fables: Cozy Narrative Adventure!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP/Vista/7/8 or 10.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3 GHz Intel Core 2 Duo or better.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9 compatible video card with at least 1024MB of VRAM.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["InkForge Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","